<title>Southern Thailand: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/thailand/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-thailand-2026-10-22T18:41:31.651Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 18:41:31 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Violent attacks persist in the southern insurgency zone, with pipe bombs wounding army officers and security volunteers in Narathiwat and Yala and grenade attacks in Trang, while Thai security forces killed suspected drug couriers and seized half a tonne of ice in Phetchaburi. The Thai Army proposed sending cadets to China for military training and announced six trust measures to test Cambodia’s sincerity, reflecting new diplomatic engagement. The WTO and multilateral partners reviewed progress on a supply-chain finance initiative, and China issued a travel warning over kidnapping and job scams targeting Thailand. The UCDP recorded 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wto.org/english/news_e/news26_e/trfin_16oct26_517_e.htm&quot;&gt;World Trade Organization&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxNRlR2Wl9JSDNvVWxhbnRhS0M3RDZDSzFnUFlwdk5FcVl3anlkamhjdkVxb2ZoTno0X0s1LUJYZlE4S3JveUNiQ1FhRE8wZ2lZTTJFMmFabjZUY2gxVmRuY2ZnVURpTEhQaXZLajN4c2dTRXhpeHJMU2RtbmFKU1Y3OWVnRGJmaUZCcFd0SVlsVUhRTGpUQ3U1M3diZDZzelpV?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khmer Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxOaThuQWZlaXB6b1JRV1RWdk9pOG1LLTh5UlpTRGk5aUwwSldEZFZodkh0TkVxbng5MWt5NjY2YWIzSU1pX0RsR0lnckxlZmtwRFVTTzJkRjZvUWFEektCRnVyd05tY2VoTVFOaGpHV1NCN0lLYzhCTWpKYnBJZ0VNdHB0b28xMmlsWUoyUnZuNlpZSFJLZlRSWlBsTy1QQ1djYTZZ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khmer Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxQUkdpUnEwTVAzeFItXzllWmtDbXc1OVgzUVRwU0FZS19SWlVZU3hHa0dhOVdMZVo3UU1LSEtnZlFpQ0hqaUpqSk9ILW9JcjJjRHRyVE5lZDRoUmVBLTBMWmVXUnlXYjh4VFFJUklrbWxfVW1nTnNMN29QaU14dTE4Ri1QSmxmSXRSaVlDbTk3TGUwbTdVOUxmQWFfTGdjS1U?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khmer Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxPaWl1V